{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1331,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78192381085bef6e95ef36c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨天风风搞错辣度，\r\n吃到了中辣咖哩……唔呜！\r\n牙龈到现在都还麻麻的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9895a1f0e9790064878e7b4f66b96146df778fb32dcb3687898a5e597859af9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eae6d61b0838b23d7a7faa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰告诉风风，只要说出\r\n「风风要在你心中留下咬痕，咬咬」\r\n保证能在演唱会超吸睛喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2a0c84b544769ee882719e5b3e3ec2f0445d0d37e73552a07ae5ba9fc9154d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:872509f80237b3cd37cedfb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上轻飘飘的服装好不自在啊……\r\n快点让风风换下来～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d03b82dcf4176f6e2de504da6ead6ce5ca4dc2f77002f73997a86fe4b4719f40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ed864524057bd880e570810",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风风的毛毛也很蓬松柔软！\r\n不输给晨光喔！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bd3fb2455fa95299b1a00dbfd6b1e31e4627e830543420b8edd75a073cee9fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:164bb6ee32c38af8434bd420",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵！这套服装还有第二型态喔！\r\n至于会是什么样子嘛……\r\n现在风风还在想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26990cd1b16b1d70fcb7df92a97fdd6e3591206592faa230eace4cc0b2fd385d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d59d1a7d7a42bd90d687cda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啾！……唔～真是好险。\r\n要是被菱亚看到又要被念\r\n「都怪你不乖乖吹头发」了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce9ce653a5c9fb3679621083f543ff27f2f1eae3c3f7662039c798cc5e2df9e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b7acdf04e4aeb0506249e09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂！吃完饭有记得刷牙吗？\r\n……如果不先磨利牙齿，\r\n遇到大猎物时就不能大口咬下喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fe20d38f538d6d71e0181239c0d709f4e63b9f0c7b35f8b1de20f2494342ecf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ae7d95cbdc4356d73d7fdbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘻嘻嘻！\r\n今天风风也要熬夜喔～！\r\n你也得陪我一起熬啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b8979bfcfb21b0ba62f493d522397a6bddd0b1869169e38a847c970e891dcce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e090e99139a9b4d5d723fc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太阳公公暖呼呼的，\r\n所以风风晒了棉被！\r\n好期待软绵绵的棉被喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "21c7aeacf0aada7eff55a31f0ce57ae1a906e2200d3adc154e4d3c7e71878af8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8575c0db83e4daaa24401f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热死了！！\r\n快带风风去训练员室！\r\n把冷气开到最冷喔～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "791010a496e20ee9b2c4004f93a44fd535b8effed3ff955e3f7d55f084e7fe8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13bac493201c9d401aecc560",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然风风爱吃肉，但秋刀鱼\r\n也很棒喔！因为它有很多骨头，\r\n对牙齿跟脑子都很好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbee28a02a5c9dec2e8dfe53af35dfd285c4d51e9036e26b6961fc000671d4f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c12463b7bcecab8ea8ec3b45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家竟然都会感冒，真没用！\r\n风风就算露出肚子睡觉也没事喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18358b7e99207f25e5ca14c14cdb245dc405f1a695b9b21ee83e512526e8914c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6d62d76e54e869f7ed2e084",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给风风来点厉害的训练吧！\r\n风风要让这套衣服变得更～加\r\n破破烂烂、更加狂野～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bef8b5ced95a3afd4b7745092d0505f81c8eb72dcca50b74a9f354951c374086",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:489a97d7bc84456246d8d4a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくのだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b3d08b0bddb55bdacc00d6b00923c1aeab7c6599b8f658a68ee39bbed00a748",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc150fd71bb59c49b621faa9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肚子上这副牙齿是预备用的喔！\r\n所以风风可以尽情用力咬……\r\n玩笑话？是真的喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42a8d72a1be8e189987612f1a2ce4897d9135b6d373d09221af4b132f1e64a11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88d042dcd9ea3dfdfeef1c9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼！今天风风也来找你啰。\r\n谁叫要是老大不在，手下自己\r\n就什么事都做不好啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab3cc557091ada71ecb6939bd7498d88ac1eeebb18fe4cc2970f7cd880fe3912",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a66f0d3f31cf193bdf22259b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看你无论如何\r\n都想求风风做训练，\r\n风风也是可以答应你啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef323dfa93ade14a4755fbf9d364886807ef67c8e4d1ccf6f3557248ddc1c52d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de33a35de7c644fa1fafbea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇哈哈！\r\n风风要让自己的臭名\r\n变得更加更～加出名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6841309e772edcabc9dab8a7d288b51d4bef9530e02bd3cd6ed8a7853147198d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27980091d7ed5c85ffcfa2fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要做什么啊？\r\n你老是能想到\r\n满有趣的点子呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13d47c6c7368f3bc9c6b8e81b79e4c001a2e0b39bf2a5a56f7d1b7b137c92307",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e737e7ade439e5e504ce298f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风风大人是无敌的！\r\n是不是啊？……嘻嘻嘻！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e33bb3dd725ef18742e76327689368b7cb3ebd718dccdcd0eeacc091f95785",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e34add6f4e2dbf246247c74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶嘿嘿！结束后风风要吃\r\n超硬的胡～萝～卜～冰～♪\r\n好期待喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b6208cfa9d90fdf18edce02988bbbd5c876dae22a9931d6f09ce887bf8ebc18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d00874899d40709b7b7c2edb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因有手下在……老大才是老大！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d3f592087129a324fd98b90ae5e23edf26f07595a3724e8360ce6dff9e45a9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6785c99b8208a76e186d024f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟你一起恶作剧也不错！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9fac2744698be6974b726a6c41891c738732e534eaa7776f3f4bc9bed4ed0ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51e2f47eddd74a7905582513",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（闪亮──！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "766d3415443aec2835568dfd02f8c8abc65a1cde058bbe6945fc722fe0da8835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94142fa0730781fc5b4a0193",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咬碎一切！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb653566751ccdb8e860c988f191925d0a5709fd6c4c94ce0c97b1daf8c59c6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c76de57bf5b8b92958131d08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シンコウウインディちゃんなのだ！ガオーッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "907ad7b92e408e50aa28eb39314cb26400fdf64cc4903b58606879339915c0c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d750ab91275dd3b4889066eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘎吼吼吼！发现猎物！\r\n风风要恶作剧啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cd614c29f633a49ad982b7c4b8a1fae18b8cc0f174fbec0b0d4f1bb918897e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a98dc546f538b60edfa593c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要做更多的恶作剧喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb109d1e92a0ed9e81f559e84b2a8cc66d2d30c626711b674659bb16d995e1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11138f6831e7d2638a09c7a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风风我可是很厉害的喔──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc4f177547a8deebca60f3a64f2870e2a2af2b0e14edbad99aef22b13b81266c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bab2edccc1db0e28a2421cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让大家见识我们的魔法吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93114eadea650eda7ab8c00c254672cfada58aa4046ab1e5713aee6e6cbdc384",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e584026d9280a41e04b0c22e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你真是个怪人！\r\n明明看起来呆呆的，却能发现\r\nSweepy的力量。真是莫名其妙！",
      "source_fingerprint": "468a1df3837ae96753ae80da60fc1c600c7fc6f26b829612cd5b263602ef6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89cfd6e5bef0fec19b0116af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e42824481b89139758cebcbc6de379bc2bfe391af6bc5931ce02cac1bdb2432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41282ac93c79a4c7d32c991f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4f3bf7806be1bd2dd3042a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要不要不要～～～～！！\r\n既然你是我的使魔，\r\n就该一直待在我身边听我的话～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3d3ca2b053657f979b942cfd942f743276b95241459af0ba64ff5ac1a501b35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbfbada92b7e85002630bfed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我一点都不感激使魔。\r\n真是的～！\r\n是魔法小狗搞错了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "baf5550dba5c439c1c9099dc0460aa16119341488b678d98fdc68977734d82bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a3963a6a9c69e152b205ec7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "使魔使魔，给我压岁钱！\r\n啊，要用可爱的红包袋装喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7a697559b1354a2519f3f022a41d2157340a6f5d594e7bee6edd99ca1174cc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c8c3962334d18b28301358a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快去准备多到要用两手才\r\n抱得住的情人节巧克力过来！\r\n身为使魔，这是理所当然的吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "841be0576271712de449bfbfade7940857891d0c7072828ed0d133892e60003b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9461216be6e93b721bee8267",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我有帮你准备巧克力喔。\r\n先说好，你不能全部吃光喔，\r\n有一半是我要吃的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b33b938c4a8e6de66e9534e1e968a7247cfb7850a2aec53505e47ea893a6e092",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94b62992a80631bab898904c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "写在短签上的愿望？\r\n这种事还需要问吗？当然是希望\r\n「Sweepy的所有愿望都能实现」♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "88b34d6e0b211bbce8ffad483f9c0d900ff7524a0e82cfb72f014f2f90b11854",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5f65889f9dd273d9b68f076",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节快乐☆\r\n我不仅要点心，还要捣蛋！\r\n我要对你使出搔痒魔法～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3413418f2a97fe4da47c8ec830028aacf03e07ef026b57a8bc6c7d03d8f271c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10563c41c8494ffd499deeb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今年一定要抓到圣诞老人！\r\n然后我绝对、绝对要他教我\r\n怎么用雪橇在天上飞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bdbc21039243ffb36faba52f6256e132dad3529bf62be830c74d1eec55d22c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b19645eb74cd3c39d3f8394b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也有准备圣诞礼物吧？\r\n快点跟我交换吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f577751a9d8a53fd98bdd3b38134565b1af155bf716d71877e6e1ce639ea173",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b5e2b83fea3f5a9002710ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cf3eef450f25ca7f9c454b895a583457c35aa18789822f9cda7a9d84d736fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6368b5dc7fd6804fffff6be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大扫除？我才不要做那么麻烦的事！\r\n我要钻进暖炉桌睡觉，\r\n使魔你加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91d588006375c46c1c8954f41a1e9b59d8f43205ca37532c63200a8d8bbc9174",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dcc4bdf658ab8c1081b7c60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你今天生日吧。\r\n会吃蛋糕吗？\r\n吃的时候记得叫我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4e640f3825618de78e06ae021b5d2fa90b25b426a12edc4337418b504d17c75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:795656807cf754b7572bc505",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我替你想了一个生日的\r\n特别魔法……好了！\r\n快点把眼睛闭上吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2da24371bf6c8a2ab4c9d8b9f31e735f0b1a13a623de81386b052da1f497cd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21e24b4ae9f6d4edf4b023b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "使魔绝、对、记、得\r\n今天是什么日子吧？\r\n……就是那个「生」开头的日子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "222dc57b545878885f41db8c4a6aeb1fcd09cd3e6550615103e7fa4fc3a64ea0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f917d6e98ab6d04b583558f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是我的生日，\r\n所以你要一直待在我身边任我差遣！\r\n听懂了吗！……绝对要哟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edc5e7665a2bfc23e15dbb0b98b3a705cc3cd1d6b77d657a5f0633f2b6dca745",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:786d1d7395dd0cd4467c2578",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新公告。\r\n你去确认一下，\r\n然后告诉我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4cf2492a738bb0745fe25e1978edbfa0e39e16974a214aff22dff3132932012",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3dd1e6c3252cb2fd01adc19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你收到礼物了。\r\n如果有好吃的点心，\r\n要拿来给我喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b37a6ea35feddf80e428efd27005dd695bf076226e0f618795b8d93346bae25e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccff9220f10c63cb30f7ab63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你达成任务了呢！\r\n不过，既然你是Sweepy的使魔，\r\n这也是当然的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "493557c4d74b3e94394c8b8c592480882604d8259d33e4f74a10d3b72a65df97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b612f70c7a992990caf1173",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之后好像要举办活动！\r\n我们也要参加，\r\n你要好好准备喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a19453e5659413a037381c6a2f5e4b105abee57b6f1e6f58864d04e0cbb6d49c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f45b05b424bde8bc27b34304",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，我们去看活动吧！\r\n别发呆了，\r\n快点带我去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55b1caaa26bea823c2a78ee183febc15c2d960333570d932e1fe92d6f4fd3d93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aa4857ce2f51dc509bc35f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么可能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bf21339b55771e854d8c8eae179d3dd5d468df5e8ae85b43ee10cdb188ffd2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be492a82fa4b14b7be030017",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n似乎提升了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62373257b62c685455424e3a3fa50458a539ee0c21d449dd38cde2dbb6d6ff77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47ae3a0f576e49e95f02b916",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これ、ただの服じゃないのよ。\r\nいつも手洗いで魔力を込めてるの！\r\nほら、虜になりそうな紅色でしょ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea10799ef24c903a499f615d892c48cc3f61341190a454a9ebd85176eef0e812",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89edbad240c52a344e25ac8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服を着たアタシ、小さいころの\r\nグランマにすごく似てるんだって♪\r\n大魔女の才能がある証拠ね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50a46f0dcccda4c3c05e76e3d110b841d472d841061a22c27adb3e3bcd752623",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5083fbd7d5df14e7e1ec46c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黒猫がネクタイにじゃれるから、\r\nすぐボロボロになるのよ、もう！\r\n予備がいくつあっても足りないわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86b32d296d67fd5f4d53d48e6c55e7c05210691bc8ba9ad9906a67cc203bc3a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc11f6b845599caef8ce4598",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很厉害嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4fe55e48ef55a9ce8c2add90f08c94d628535308f3b8f7b4d98f0790e17fdc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e31b010925642352832c42ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是魔法的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ed88d9cd05f0af6becf5c7a13ed0ddb888cec34c6eca63d7e15d2920e48e4bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
